<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australian bonds eye US for post-Xmas goodies.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australian bonds eye US for post-Xmas goodies.</headline>
<text>
<p>----------(Snapshot at 4.35 P.M./0535 GMT)------------------</p>
<p>FUTURES					  CASH YIELD</p>
<p>90-DAY BILLS  (MAR) 94.10  (- 0.01)    6.02    (UNCH)</p>
<p>3-YR T-BONDS  (MAR) 93.30  (- 0.02)    6.56    (+ 0.02)</p>
<p>10-YR T-BONDS (MAR) 92.480 (+0.005)    7.44    (UNCH)</p>
<p>AUD/USD  0.7962 (PREV 0.7991) US 30-YR  6.58   (6.59 NY)</p>
<p>---------------------(Dec 27)-------------------------------</p>
<p>*Australian bonds closed little changed from their pre-Christmas levels as they again waited for inspiration from the U.S with November U.S. durable goods orders due later today.</p>
<p>*Market underperforms dollar bloc in illiquid trade.</p>
</text>
